close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"Гостиничный ресторан отличается медленным обслуживанием и древнерусскими словечками в меню, хотя к русской кухне всё это отношения не имеет. Умеренно хорошие отзывы, вечером может быть живая музыка. Если вы просто идёте мимо, не пропустите крупную надпись «Полисть» на фасаде — забавный артефакт советского времени.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"ru:Старая Русса"},{"id":"staraya_russa_wv_cafe_tortuga","areaId":"staraya_russa","name":"Cafe Tortuga","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":57.98964,"lng":31.36989},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":1,"photoSeed":"staraya_russa_wv_cafe_tortuga","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["cafetortuga","starayarussa"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"10:00","close":"21:00"},{"open":"10:00","close":"21:00"},{"open":"10:00","close":"21:00"},{"open":"10:00","close":"21:00"},{"open":"10:00","close":"21:00"},{"open":"10:00","close":"21:00"},{"open":"10:00","close":"21:00"}]},"summary":"Launched as a café for children, this eatery eventually transformed into a cheap bar colloquially known as ryumochnaya. It is not the best place to eat unless you are deeply interested in local drinking traditions, or simply want to taste savoury pirozhki that are on sale here.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Staraya Russa"},{"id":"staraya_russa_wv_kafe_bashnya","areaId":"staraya_russa","name":"Кафе «Башня»","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":57.99448,"lng":31.3486},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":2,"photoSeed":"staraya_russa_wv_kafe_bashnya","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["кафебашня","starayarussa"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"Находится не в самой водонапорной башне, но в соседнем с ней доме, из окон которого хороший вид на центральную (Соборную) площадь. Единственное в городе заведение, способное похвастаться собственным стилем в интерьере и оригинальным приготовлением блюд. Хорошие отзывы. Wi-Fi.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"ru:Старая Русса"},{"id":"staraya_russa_wv_cafe_sadko","areaId":"staraya_russa","name":"Cafe Sadko","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":57.9907,"lng":31.35354},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":1,"photoSeed":"staraya_russa_wv_cafe_sadko","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["cafesadko","starayarussa"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"09:00","close":"21:00"},{"open":"09:00","close":"21:00"},{"open":"09:00","close":"21:00"},{"open":"09:00","close":"21:00"},{"open":"09:00","close":"21:00"},{"open":"09:00","close":"21:00"},{"open":"09:00","close":"21:00"}]},"summary":"Another cheap café with a very convenient location, where you can get tolerable, basic Russian food like beef kotlety or stuffed cabbage. Semi self-serve—order at the counter.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Staraya Russa"},{"id":"staraya_russa_wv_cafe_bashnya","areaId":"staraya_russa","name":"Cafe Bashnya","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":57.99074,"lng":31.35491},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":2,"photoSeed":"staraya_russa_wv_cafe_bashnya","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"https://vk.com/bashnya_kafe","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["cafebashnya","starayarussa"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"23:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"23:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"23:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"23:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"23:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"23:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"23:00"}]},"summary":"This eatery with a cryptic name offers what now became the most popular food in Russia: pizza and sushi. Fortunately, they are not mixing it. Free Wi-Fi.","